  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 breaks
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Settled, card says Saved
  s1: Saving one move
  s2: Saving two moves
  s3: Settled, card says Applied
  s4: Settled, card says Interviewing
  s5: Settled with error banner, card says Saved
  s6: Settled with error banner, card says Applied
  s7: Settled, card says Interviewing but saved as Applied
  s8: Settled, card says Saved but saved as Applied
  s9: Settled, card says Applied but saved as Interviewing
  s10: Settled with error banner, card says Interviewing
  s11: Settled, card says Saved but saved as Interviewing
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you pick a new stage
  s1 --> s2: you pick a new stage
  s1 --> s3: a reply reaches the page
  s2 --> s2: the server saves a request or a reply reaches the page
  s1 --> s4: a reply reaches the page
  s3 --> s2: you pick a new stage
  s4 --> s2: you pick a new stage
  s1 --> s5: a reply reaches the page
  s2 --> s10: a failure reaches the page or a reply reaches the page
  s2 --> s5: a failure reaches the page or a reply reaches the page
  s2 --> s7: a reply reaches the page
  s2 --> s8: a reply reaches the page
  s2 --> s4: a reply reaches the page
  s2 --> s0: a reply reaches the page
  s2 --> s6: a failure reaches the page or a reply reaches the page
  s2 --> s3: a reply reaches the page
  s2 --> s9: a reply reaches the page
  s2 --> s11: a reply reaches the page
  s5 --> s2: you pick a new stage
